# Line endings.
#
# These files execute on Linux. Git on Windows would otherwise check them out
# with CRLF, and a shell script with CRLF fails as:
#     /usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory
# which is a failed pod provision discovered after paying for a GPU.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf

# Python runs either way, but keeping it uniform avoids diffs that are entirely
# line endings.
*.py            text eol=lf

# Never touched.
*.onnx          binary
*.pth           binary
*.npy           binary
*.mp4           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.png           binary
